# ## NOTE: keep the dependency lists below free of '#' comments. abuild does not
# source the APKBUILD's lists as shell comments - it word-splits the string and
# hands every word to apk - so a comment inside depends= or makedepends= becomes
# a package name and deps fails on the first word apk cannot parse.
