# Alpine's source list, plus three ungoogled additions: the ungoogled source
# tarball, and a vendored copy of the 3pp TypeScript patch, because ungoogled
# prunes third_party/typescript/linux-amd64/ - and with it the 3pp tree Alpine
# reads that patch from. Alpine's google-api.keys is dropped, see _configure.
source="
